  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Kosovo 2008-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statistics Kosovo 2008-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projektet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja Statistical Office Kosovo (SOK) med ekonomisk statistik och agroekonomi; energi och milj&#xf6;statistik, social statistik och allm&#xe4;nt kapacitetsst&#xf6;d. St&#xf6;dets design &#xe4;r l&#xe5;ngtidskonsulter p&#xe5; SOK och korttidsuppdrag fr&#xe5;n SCB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The main objectives are to support development of Statistical Office Kosovo (SOK) in economic statistics including agro economy; energy and environmental statistics; social statistics and general capacity building. The support includes long-time consultancy at SOK and short-term missions from Statistics Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
